## Sol decision

The implementation plan is complete enough to execute gate-by-gate, but the requested global outcome is not achieved. Do not install package code or parallel schemas. Preserve existing native software and quarantine ancestry. Resume only when exact bytes/rights or user-supplied stock, bottle, preparation and physical evidence change the gate state.

All formula, inventory, stock, bottle, physical, sensory, analytical, headspace, strict-OAV, safety, procurement, installation, publication and release authority remains false.
